{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"へんに悩んじゃってなんか\n最終的にめんどくさくなっちゃって\nみたいになることが多いんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/12/1941394/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪色変えようと思うんだけど\nどんな感じにしようかな〜〜。\nいつもはアッシュなんだけど\nちょっと変化がほしい(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム個別ありがとう\nございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/12/1941394/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽ノック！だいすきな衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が並んで\nくださってほんとにありがたき\n幸せです。いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目の握手会が9月になっちゃう\nので先になりますが浴衣で待ってるので\nみなさんぜひ会いに来てね〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと！\n10月29日の個別でもハロウィンの\n仮装をしようと思うので、\n23.29の2日間仮装します(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日にやるって書いた後に\n追加の29日に気付いたので...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じで！みなさんぜひ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/12/1941394/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近みおなちゃんと日奈子ちゃんと\n写真撮ってないなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/12/1941394/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは\nばいばーーい！"}],"source":"archive"}